/**
 * @file
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Doxygen group definitions for all subsystems.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarDocs Interstellar Documentation
 * @brief Meta-group for all Doxygen group definitions and documentation conventions.
 *
 * Contains high-level organizational groupings for the Interstellar game engine.
 * This group helps centralize documentation of core subsystems and modular interfaces.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarCore Interstellar Core
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Foundational engine utilities, including logging, diagnostics, and system bootstrapping.
 *
 * This includes core systems like logging (`Logger`), severity enums (`LogLevel`),
 * and lifecycle hooks shared across modules (data, config, input, rendering, etc.).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup LogLevelUtils Log Level Utilities
 * @ingroup InterstellarCore
 * @brief String parsing and formatting utilities for log levels.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup LoggingSystem Logging System
 * @ingroup InterstellarCore
 * @brief Engine-wide logging interfaces and adaptive flushing mechanisms.
 *
 * Defines the `Logger` class, log categories, and flush strategies based on severity levels.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup Initialization Initialization Utilities
 * @ingroup InterstellarCore
 * @brief Engine startup routines and bootstrap interfaces.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InputSystem Input System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Core module for handling user input (mouse, keyboard, etc.).
 *
 * The Input module abstracts platform-specific device handling and exposes
 * interfaces for querying input states. This includes real-time polling and
 * frame-based state transitions.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup GameInterfaces Game Interfaces
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Public input interfaces exposed to game logic.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup EngineInterfaces Engine Interfaces
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Internal abstract extensions of the public input interfaces.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup KeyCodes KeyCode Definitions
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Enumerates unified key identifiers for cross-platform input abstraction.
 *
 * `KeyCode` allows consistent input mapping across supported platforms.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup PlatformImplementations Platform Implementations
 * @ingroup InputSystem
 * @brief Concrete input backends for specific platforms (GLFW, SDL, etc.).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarData Interstellar Data
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Shared scientific, physical, and domain-specific game data.
 *
 * Includes definitions such as chemical elements, planetary constants,
 * material properties, and scientific reference information used in simulation and rendering.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup InterstellarConfig Interstellar Config
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Configuration framework for serializing/deserializing game data.
 *
 * Includes JSON-driven configuration management, file IO abstraction,
 * editor serialization, and persistent runtime settings.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup ConfigStorage Config Storage
 * @ingroup InterstellarConfig
 * @brief Abstract file system interfaces for reading and writing configs.
 *
 * Includes `IConfigStorage`, `FileSystem`, and related components.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup JsonConfig Json Configuration
 * @ingroup InterstellarConfig
 * @brief Interfaces and utilities for JSON-based configuration objects.
 *
 * Includes `IJsonConfig`, `JsonConfigBase`, `JsonManager`, and `AppConfig`.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup RenderingSystem Rendering System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief [Reserved] Placeholder for rendering pipeline interfaces and systems.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup SimulationSystem Simulation System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief [Reserved] Placeholder for game simulation, AI, and logic orchestration.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup AudioSystem Audio System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief [Reserved] Placeholder for audio mixing, playback, and device interfaces.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup UISystem UI System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief [Reserved] Placeholder for user interface frameworks and layout systems.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup SaveLoadSystem Save/Load System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief [Reserved] Placeholder for game state persistence and serialization.
 */
